@host = https://localhost:7001
@token = paste-access-token-here

### Log in as the test driver
POST {{host}}/api/driver/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "driver@yourco.com", "password": "your-dev-driver-password" }

### Who am I?
GET {{host}}/api/driver/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clock in (watch the driver turn green on the board)
POST {{host}}/api/driver/clock-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Today's route
GET {{host}}/api/driver/route
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send a GPS point (update recordedAt to within the last day)
POST {{host}}/api/driver/locations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[{ "lat": 38.8850, "lng": -77.1000, "accuracy": 8, "recordedAt": "2026-10-26T15:00:00Z" }]

### Mark a stop as arrived (use a stop id from the route response)
POST {{host}}/api/driver/stops/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "Arrived" }

### Order API (create a key on the Clients page first)
POST {{host}}/api/intake/orders
Authorization: Bearer dk_paste-your-key
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "1001",
  "recipient": { "name": "Jane Doe", "phone": "703-555-0142" },
  "dropoff": { "address": "1100 Wilson Blvd, Arlington, VA 22209" },
  "notes": "Leave with the front desk"
}
